  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Independently qualify the owner-published immutable Codecs archive and its exact IR/Quantities dependency closure from physical NUGET_LOCAL readback and fifteen compiled package-only binary probes. RS163 never publishes.",
    "value": "Verify three original private archives and embedded DLL hashes, exact direct IR and transitive Quantities dependencies, restore an isolated Codecs PackageReference consumer from a disposable snapshot, and prove shared-feed archives unchanged.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "RS162 completed first-pass publisher rehearsal on a disposable feed. It did not establish actual private Codecs publication, which is a separately authorized owner action.",
      "RS163 requires the original RS161 Codecs archive to be physically present in NUGET_LOCAL with its exact qualified 35096-byte SHA. It refuses an absent or altered package.",
      "Independent physical verification cannot claim public licensing, installed rollback, other OS support, cross-repository migration or broad feed certification."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After RS163 passes with physical feed evidence, select a next unpublished Math package for bounded qualification. Preserve owner-only publication and independent readback gates.",
    "achievements": []
  },
